# Qualified project/config/source inputs are byte-bound to build receipts.
# Preserve their original bytes across Windows and other checkouts.
LivingTown.uproject -text
Config/** -text
Source/** -text whitespace=cr-at-eol
Content/** -text
*.md text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
.gitattributes text eol=lf
*.uasset binary
*.umap binary
*.ubulk binary
*.uexp binary
